Built from the reusable parts of Rapture Chess. Rapture characters, names, avatars, arena models and artwork are
(c) LitVM Games, all rights reserved, and are not part of this template: its pieces are procedural and its arena neutral.

Vendored code, copied byte for byte and pinned by sha256 in each folder's MANIFEST.json:
- vendor/litnode/: LitNode (https://github.com/strodanodev/litnode), Apache-2.0. The title bundler, the conformance
  suite, the title sandbox and the protocol modules they and the relay test use.
- src/vendor/tcg/: the Rapture SDK TCG kit (packages/tcg), Apache-2.0. The wallet and holdings layer (web/lib) and the
  arcade-shell client (src/client/shell.ts).

The sample game uses chess.js (BSD-2-Clause), bundled into the built ruleset and the site.
